
  db_audit_gm -- PostgreSQL 18 database node

  Configuration:  /etc/postgresql/postgresql.conf, /etc/postgresql/pg_hba.conf
  Connect:        psql            (as role dba; password in ~/.pgpass)
  Apply changes:  sudo gm-reload-db     reload the configuration
                  sudo gm-restart-db    restart PostgreSQL (checks the files first)
  Check:          sudo gm-validate      public validator (envelopes, GM line, server)
  Logs:           /var/log/postgresql/  (readable; analyse them with pgbadger,
                  e.g. pgbadger /var/log/postgresql/*.log -o ~/pgbadger.html)

  DO NOT TAMPER with SSH, sudo, the gm-* wrappers, the validator, or the
  line `local all postgres peer` in pg_hba.conf (the GM's access).

